  "limitations": [
    "Input fixture preparation only; no systemd guest has executed, and no distribution qualification is implied.",
    "One root Type=oneshot service and normal manager poweroff only; no installed distribution boot, journald, udev, networking, PAM login or optional dlopen-feature qualification.",
    "The exact pinned Ubuntu systemd 255.4-1ubuntu8.12, executor, shutdown and ELF interpreter/DT_NEEDED closure are inspected, never run on the host.",
    "Seven bounded BusyBox/glibc shell checks plus one systemd supervision check; no complete syscall, allocator, signal or timer coverage.",
    "8 MiB workload tmpfs and 64 KiB allocation/file checks only; no disk persistence or stress qualification.",
    "Fresh UUID and eight matching workloads plus independently observed host ACPI S5 are mandatory; fixture construction or poweroff alone is not success.",
    "Successful ExecStartPost proves manager-observed successful oneshot main-process completion, not a long-running Type=notify service readiness contract."
